Event When <code>consent.granted</code>, <code>consent.denied</code>, <code>consent.withdrawn</code> A principal records a decision <code>notice.published</code> A new notice version is published <code>request.opened</code>, <code>request.updated</code>, <code>request.closed</code> A rights request changes state <code>export.requested</code> An access request needs your data collected <code>erasure.warning_sent</code> A pre-erasure warning was delivered <code>erasure.due</code> An erasure is starting: delete or anonymise this principal's data for the purpose <code>erasure.completed</code> Erasure handlers finished <code>erasure.processor_notified</code> A processor must be told to erase (includes the processor id) <code>erasure.needs_attention</code> A warning or erasure failed and needs a person <code>ledger.root_exported</code>, <code>ledger.tampered</code> Root-hash export; failed ledger verification <p>The body is the event itself:</p> <pre><code>{
  "id": "ev_4c1d…",
  "type": "consent.withdrawn",
  "tenant_id": "default",
  "occurred_at": "2027-06-01T09:00:00Z",
  "data": {"principal": "u_42", "purpose": "marketing"}
}
</code></pre>
